  <!-- lastmod IS A CLAIM ABOUT THE FILE, AND A STALE ONE SUPPRESSES RECRAWL.
       Every URL below carried 2026-03-14 while /webdesign/ was rewritten
       repeatedly through August and September, so the one signal that tells a
       crawler "this changed, read it again" was saying the opposite. When you
       change a page, change its lastmod in the same commit; AGENTS.md already
       requires this file to match the site, and a date is part of matching.

       Dates below are sourced, not guessed: the offer page from the site repo
       commit that changed it (21d9c51, 2026-09-19), the three policy pages from
